	"Description": "I like to call it the Fishing Revenue Rescue Program .\n<br />Currently 44 small insects from the game Terraria have been added, they can be found in Stardew Valley as foraging items.\n<br />Added 3 pills to improve your fishing income.\n<br />Added a new machine for making pills, which can be unlocked at fishing level 5, and the raw materials are various small insects.\n<br />Added a Fishing Potion, unlockable and craftable at Fishing Level 1.\n<br />Added all fish in Terraria as crab pot fish to improve the economic benefits of crab pots.\n<br />\n<br />All art is from the official Terraria wiki.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />我愿称之为 钓鱼类收益拯救计划 。\n<br />目前添加了来自游戏泰拉瑞亚的44种小昆虫，他们可以作为觅食物品在星露谷中被找到。\n<br />添加了3种药丸拯救你的钓鱼收入。\n<br />添加了一个新机器用于制作药丸，可以在钓鱼5级时解锁，原料为各类小昆虫。\n<br />添加了一个钓鱼药水，在钓鱼1级时就可以解锁并制作。\n<br />添加了所有泰拉瑞亚里的鱼作为蟹笼鱼，以提高蟹笼的经济收益。\n<br />\n<br />所有的美术都来自泰拉瑞亚官方wiki。",
